      "description": "Read-only for explicit status, returned actions/job IDs, or the get_docs_context language preflight. Reports host project_binding and delivery_configuration. No discovery/preparation. action=project uses host binding or explicit project_path; action=library needs canonical_id; module is an exact path. Cache language by scope/version/snapshot; unknown/mixed/partial is not English. Omit details unless diagnostics are needed.",
